{"ref":"BDB, קְנִזִּי","hw":"קְנִזִּי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קְנִזִּי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent.</strong> c. art. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקּ׳</span>, of Caleb <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:12\" href=\"/Numbers.32.12\">Nu 32:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:6\" href=\"/Joshua.14.6\">Jos 14:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:14\" href=\"/Joshua.14.14\">14</a> (all JE); as n.coll. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:19\" href=\"/Genesis.15.19\">Gn 15:19</a> (in list; appar. S. Canaanitish people).","next":"BDB, קֵנִי","prev":"BDB, קְנַז"}